        "category": "class",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The ground on which you stride is mere fuel that you burn with unholy void energies, scarring the earth in your wake. When a holy creature or psychopomp ends its turn within 10 feet of you, it takes 2 spirit damage. If it's a holy living creature, it takes an additional 2 void damage. At 10th level and every 4 levels thereafter, the spirit and void damage each increase by 2. Corrupted Ground lasts for 1 minute, but you can Dismiss it.</p>"
